y, the die will have been cast this week.Show more Following the pivotal election day on November 5th, there’s no one better to break down what is at stake, and what we likely have in store for us under a new administration than journalist Shannon Joy.\nOn her broadcast, The Shannon Joy Show, Shannon consistently stands for principles, not parties. From dissecting current events to challenging the status quo, her mission is to empower her audience with the knowledge and courage to think for themselves.\nWe can’t wait to hear this critical discussion and where the great minds of today see the future of health freedom in the months and years ahead.\nAs always, join us and bring your friends!\nSupport the work of VSRF at https://VacSafety.org/donate\nDonations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text LIBERTY to 53555 Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/-/B/3/p/-B3pu.qR4e-small-VSRF-Live-151-Election-Resu.jpg", "display_id": "v5jzvu5", "fulltitle": "VSRF Live #151: Election Results and Health Outcomes", "duration_string": "1:34:37", "upload_date": "20241105", "release_date": "20241108", "release_year": 2024, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777719108, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/2/-/B/3/p/-B3pu.aaa.rec.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-1080p-1", "fps": 30, "tbr": 4748, "filesize": 3370109738, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1920x1080", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "mp4-1080p-1 - 1920x1080", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a6b6fe4